<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Prospe on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tags/prospe/</link><description>Recent content in Prospe on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ca</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tags/prospe/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2026-01-17 - Roots Habits al Casal de barri de Prosperitat</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2026/01/17/2026-01-17-roots-habits-al-casal-de-barri-de-prosperitat/</link><pubDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2026/01/17/2026-01-17-roots-habits-al-casal-de-barri-de-prosperitat/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/iuRLRjgHfUyoAbXi7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/DSCF2655-1024x683.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aquest dissabte hem gaudit d’una &lt;strong&gt;Nit de Reggae&lt;/strong&gt; —passada per aigua, cal remarcar-ho— al nostre Casal de barri, el de la Prospe!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tot i la pluja i el fred —que sempre fan una mica de mandra a l’hora de sortir—, la vetllada va arrencar gairebé puntual amb els &lt;strong&gt;Roots Habits&lt;/strong&gt; i el seu Roots Rock Reggae Dub arrelat a Catalunya.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baix, guitarra, bateria, teclats i vents —saxo i trompeta— van ser les seves armes, acompanyant una veu que transmet un missatge propi i reflexiu. En el seu so s’hi poden reconèixer influències de Bob Marley, Peter Tosh, Tribal Seeds i Groundation, tot combinant riddims envoltants amb lletres que conviden a pensar.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-05-27 – Festa major de Prosperitat – dissabte tarda-nit</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/05/28/2023-05-27-festa-major-de-prosperitat-dissabte-tarda-nit/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 May 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/05/28/2023-05-27-festa-major-de-prosperitat-dissabte-tarda-nit/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/x7cm6tbz1p45hyp47"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/_NYSVL1ZNzbV1CZJJhRps8MvwXSTvyVuzRqaLWdwli6_f5qRR3f7zMN3QqUkHl2FagRqXmK2w0miCl03Td6MKzQVlWgXapAJc8IiRcFmT5Hhw8IwPBpNUxjB7x_AXGVv4n9jKZ4YYmAESUN0o9W21dSEIWn4yO3Gebrp1yNg6Rx_1X0hvu4-MJ9QS_OrQVGpWsrp8WiAwuO6sDhKphXKARl59ENqu1-WYlbWooIUfDNp0pkKSG6i-bzLgGN1z_RUYgnRroplawj2jMJZZg3h9YDQ_PfgXkDiG3AKcsuw_p3tYWsJMU9JcSh7xilp5JzYZHPdo28DdZwLFZyBeFlK4AFO5ZEhMIvSBXrpJcJOkvFMPjTE25E-7pgWcMw9qkPSeygzVSaLeNrC2P4okYvLO2_QhKE5q5Z2eJaF_z60ctrX8D1IzcEK2eOydkEHHK6aSDEWZ5d0PbV_qF6xwK_JI_exVCLZsnu1BWY3XaoF8oR2WtWKcU2oSwk2Gh8boRhHBGBxNz-YPRcGT3Bj60osoTirzv1eBMatM4pGrA9PlUnMq-bt__5dLrerLVUYdDGqnhccHlrgWLqg9WG50gy8U4iTPQMcSzI8wWsUfIVFy9iJhUpqt1Vw8gmnT2p-_B7P2ffP67mfSSftZA52cVTKOaOfPDfiuPCltusxk3gDYjxVo4sAKFKyK_zLrBfJLrfHx6bmVbFdjpKXedmo7-GkJO2QcnsNCffRg9Kfi2nzNK072WrzkUyKWj746fnvobQC1mVmN9iMrGaf_uhmS5mKDOKVgqAmHsserdKOrJmZLqepq_lBYv42Mrsl_8bCFkX_jPK6UgsJstNuMWBkD3c6LsAbgrLt87SeeYC-ne9PgVwssxE2GYAlYtDJCNq4CwdF0kkalfG2di85770hmqzFZ6z5X8o2CRztyN-c0lipqMVFjw=w1734-h1156-s-no?authuser=0" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
